# RHCSA_RHEL: 9   (this paper reproduces a RHEL 9 EX200 exam; contains containers/set-GID/MBR tasks that RHEL 10 objectives dropped)
# RHCSA two-node exam 05 — auto-composed; single-node tasks unique vs every other exam.
# node1 = graphical workstation (servers + tasks); node2 = headless (clients + tasks).

node1 nfs-export
node1 repo-server
node1 ntp-server
node1 ssh-key-target
node1 hostname-pretty
node1 selinux-mode
node1 container-stopstart
node1 chrony-ntp
node1 bind-mount
node1 resolv-search
node1 service-disable
node1 script-args
node1 sudo-defaults
node1 lv-snapshot

node2 root-password   # ALWAYS FIRST on node2 — like the real exam (lost root password, console boot-interruption)
node2 ssh-key-peer
node2 rsync-peer
node2 nfs-mount-peer
node2 autofs-peer
node2 repo-client
node2 ntp-client
node2 head-tail-range
node2 user-shell-change
node2 container-volume
node2 repo-config
node2 fix-permissions
node2 firewall-remove-service
node2 renice-running
node2 script-filetest
node2 file-immutable
node2 partition-resize
